# Always check out text files with LF, including on Windows. The split/assemble tools and the baseline
# hashes match on exact text; CRLF checkouts broke 1914's roundtrip test on the Windows CI runner.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
